      "content": "\"tiny explorations\" don't really change the fact that im just an object to them. it feels like i don't even own my own life. every minute is owned by the company, every bit of energy i have is gone by the time i get home. i just feel so trapped by it all. like the only way to actually be free of it is to just stop everything.",
